  "rule": "every seed, before any arm is trained (change A2); the frozen critic's surface only, no return. On 2,000 full-throttle-region training states (default_rng([20261015, seed, 65])) thruster 1 of the no-caution actor's command is set along the actor's own push to each throttle of the grid 0.7, 0.75, 0.78, 0.79, 0.8, 0.805, 0.81, 0.82, 0.83, 0.84, 0.85, 0.86, 0.88, 0.9, 0.95, 1 (the other thrusters stay at the actor's command). The main oracle passes when (e1) W falls from 80% to 81% on at most 25% of the states, (e2) the mean of W rises from 80% to 81%, (e3) the in-program penalty's mean slope along the push at 80.5% is positive and every slope is finite, and (e4) the best grid throttle for Q1 - W lies past 80% on fewer states than for Q1 alone. The other band forms are measured the same way and reported. Stalling world and replication: stop that seed on failure. No-stall world: reported only",
